{"parentUuid":"c5ccd4f7-be78-448c-8378-3e1b9e62bbf9","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01N6h2Gu9dkbxtkQWF7URMnG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017uLn2ZyfkH3gRYCnq2cN1E","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://discuss.ai.google.dev/t/no-one-is-talking-about-how-to-use-the-credits-of-trial-credit-for-genai-app-builder/101423","prompt":"What does the \"Trial credit for GenAI App Builder\" $1000 promo actually cover? Can it be used for Gemini API calls (Vertex AI generative models like gemini-2.5-pro)? Or is it limited to Vertex AI Agent Builder / Agent Search / Discovery Engine only? What SKUs apply? Quote any specific user findings about whether Gemini API consumption draws down this credit."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4330,"cache_read_input_tokens":27147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4330,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4FYn9ooA5WhFEuY4FR","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ba30db2b-dbdf-4091-ad4e-952c2b4facfc","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:14.256Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ba30db2b-dbdf-4091-ad4e-952c2b4facfc","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01N6h2Gu9dkbxtkQWF7URMnG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FK5xVcRVcSyCyxXQPMssz6","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://discuss.ai.google.dev/t/it-s-about-understanding-how-different-google-cloud-and-genai-credits-are-applied-which-services-they-cover-and-how-to-ensure-your-ai-studio-or-vertex-ai-usage-consumes-credits-instead-of-real-billing/138189","prompt":"What does this thread say about GenAI App Builder $1000 trial credit scope? Does it apply to Gemini API calls on Vertex AI or only to Agent Builder / Discovery Engine SKUs? Does it apply to Google AI Studio (ai.google.dev) Gemini API? Quote specific findings."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4330,"cache_read_input_tokens":27147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4330,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4FYn9ooA5WhFEuY4FR","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a5f1ca28-2b32-4de5-8207-d5762105fded","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:17.733Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a5f1ca28-2b32-4de5-8207-d5762105fded","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01N6h2Gu9dkbxtkQWF7URMnG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EdKSUEJz972RUMNHJaMCWT","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://discuss.google.dev/t/clarification-on-1000-genai-app-builder-credit-source/350894","prompt":"What's the official clarification on the $1000 GenAI App Builder credit? What products does it cover? Does it apply to Gemini API / Vertex AI generative models, or only to Agent Builder/Discovery Engine? Quote any specific responses from Google staff or community."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4330,"cache_read_input_tokens":27147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4330,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4FYn9ooA5WhFEuY4FR","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"d3377dc8-9208-4102-995b-740baa43fbb3","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:19.696Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ba30db2b-dbdf-4091-ad4e-952c2b4facfc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"13d226c2-7030-46b3-a4a1-d92d92be18ee","agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017uLn2ZyfkH3gRYCnq2cN1E","type":"tool_result","content":"# Trial Credit for GenAI App Builder Coverage\n\nBased on the forum discussion, the Trial credit for GenAI App Builder **does not cover Gemini API calls**. Instead, it applies exclusively to specific Vertex AI services.\n\n## What It Actually Covers\n\nAccording to Google Cloud Support (as reported by krishnapathak): \"The Trial credit for the GenAI App Builder will only be applied to Vertix AI search services.\"\n\nThe credits are limited to:\n- **Vertex AI Search and Conversation** services\n- **Vertex AI Agent Builder/Discovery Engine** functionality\n\n## What It Does NOT Cover\n\nMultiple users reported unexpected charges when attempting to use these credits for:\n- Gemini API calls through Vertex AI (like gemini-2.5-pro)\n- Google AI Studio\n- Cloud Run services\n\nOne user (yanc) noted: \"i thought we can use this for gemini api, but instead i got charged tons of money.\"\n\n## Key Takeaway\n\nThe naming \"GenAI App Builder\" credits is misleading—they're restricted to Vertex AI's search and agent builder SKUs, not general Generative AI API consumption. Users should contact Google Cloud Support with their specific SKU link before using these credits to avoid unexpected billing."}]},"uuid":"852139af-5866-4b5b-bcab-6fcebdb1146e","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:19.761Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ba30db2b-dbdf-4091-ad4e-952c2b4facfc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"a5f1ca28-2b32-4de5-8207-d5762105fded","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"13d226c2-7030-46b3-a4a1-d92d92be18ee","agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FK5xVcRVcSyCyxXQPMssz6","type":"tool_result","content":"Based on the provided content, **the thread does not contain specific findings about GenAI App Builder trial credit scope.**\n\nThe original post asks clarifying questions about credit coverage but doesn't provide answers. The user inquires: \"What specific services are covered under the **GenAI App Builder trial credit**? Is it limited to certain tools (like Agent Builder / Search / RAG), or can it also be used with other AI services?\"\n\nHowever, the thread content shown includes only:\n- The initial question without responses\n- Related topic titles that suggest similar confusion exists among users\n\nThe related topics hint at broader ambiguity—one mentions credits not being consumed in AI Studio despite availability, and another asks whether credits work \"in AI Studio, or only via Vertex AI?\"—but no definitive answers about scope are provided in this excerpt.\n\n**To get accurate information about whether GenAI App Builder credits apply to Gemini API calls, Vertex AI usage, or Google AI Studio, you would need to review actual responses within this thread or consult official Google Cloud documentation.**"}]},"uuid":"4cb37143-9bfc-4bc5-925e-00a559ed696a","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:21.753Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a5f1ca28-2b32-4de5-8207-d5762105fded","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"4cb37143-9bfc-4bc5-925e-00a559ed696a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01N6h2Gu9dkbxtkQWF7URMnG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0182d6N961AG7UFhSmXX5fw6","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/codelion/openevolve","prompt":"Does OpenEvolve support Vertex AI as an LLM backend? Does the config support a custom base_url / api_base for OpenAI-compatible endpoints? Specifically is there documentation on using Vertex AI's OpenAI-compatible endpoint, or only ai.google.dev / OpenAI / Anthropic? Show config examples for Gemini."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4330,"cache_read_input_tokens":27147,"output_tokens":980,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4330},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1280,"output_tokens":980,"cache_read_input_tokens":27147,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4330,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4330,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4FYn9ooA5WhFEuY4FR","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"6712ae53-fcec-476b-8af8-b9d8c8d79f81","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:21.885Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"d3377dc8-9208-4102-995b-740baa43fbb3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"13d226c2-7030-46b3-a4a1-d92d92be18ee","agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EdKSUEJz972RUMNHJaMCWT","type":"tool_result","content":"# Summary of Available Information\n\nBased on the forum discussion provided, there is **no official Google clarification** about the $1000 GenAI App Builder credit's specific coverage or product eligibility.\n\n## What the Community Discussion Reveals\n\nA user named ROBERRT458 offers general observations rather than official guidance:\n\n> \"Google Cloud sometimes auto-assigns these GenAI App Builder credits during promos or when you activate certain AI/GenAI related services\"\n\nHowever, this is informal speculation, not an official statement.\n\n## Key Limitations\n\nThe forum thread does **not provide**:\n- Official clarification from Google staff\n- Specific products covered (Gemini API, Vertex AI, Agent Builder, Discovery Engine)\n- Definitive eligibility criteria\n- Usage restrictions by product type\n\n## Recommendation\n\nFor authoritative answers about which products this credit covers—including whether it applies to Gemini API, Vertex AI generative models, or only certain builders—you should consult:\n1. The billing dashboard's \"Promotions\" or \"Credits\" section directly\n2. Official Google Cloud documentation\n3. Direct support from Google Cloud's official support channels\n\nThe forum discussion only captures user observations, not official product policy."}]},"uuid":"ef22db8a-f1f9-4ba0-9dce-a35b841f298c","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:24.299Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d3377dc8-9208-4102-995b-740baa43fbb3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"6712ae53-fcec-476b-8af8-b9d8c8d79f81","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"13d226c2-7030-46b3-a4a1-d92d92be18ee","agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0182d6N961AG7UFhSmXX5fw6","type":"tool_result","content":"# OpenEvolve LLM Backend Support\n\nBased on the documentation provided, OpenEvolve supports **any OpenAI-compatible API** through custom configuration, but there is **no specific mention of Vertex AI support** or documentation.\n\n## What IS Documented:\n\nThe configuration clearly supports custom endpoints via `api_base`:\n\n```yaml\nllm:\n  api_base: \"https://your-custom-endpoint.com/v1\"\n  model: \"your-model-name\"\n```\n\n## Supported Backends with Examples:\n\n**Google Gemini (documented with example):**\n```yaml\nllm:\n  api_base: \"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/\"\n  model: \"gemini-2.5-pro\"\n```\n\n**Local Models (Ollama/vLLM):**\n```yaml\nllm:\n  api_base: \"http://localhost:11434/v1\"\n  model: \"codellama:7b\"\n```\n\nThe docs state: *\"OpenEvolve works with any OpenAI-compatible API\"* and list OpenAI, Google, local models, and OptiLLM as examples—but Vertex AI is not explicitly mentioned.\n\n**Bottom line:** Vertex AI's OpenAI-compatible endpoint should theoretically work via custom `api_base` configuration, but no official documentation or example is provided."}]},"uuid":"dd7e35bf-76ac-4000-8992-a3a6f9874f97","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:28.756Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6712ae53-fcec-476b-8af8-b9d8c8d79f81","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"dd7e35bf-76ac-4000-8992-a3a6f9874f97","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01FHNAabmjV3gMvPUrswnS5d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have the key answer. Let me verify the Vertex AI OpenAI-compatible endpoint detail and the official pricing page for Gemini 2.5 Pro to confirm parity."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4144,"cache_read_input_tokens":31477,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4144,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4HV3yDRqJdjJiMzW9f","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ca284d79-1fd5-46d1-bb07-4584d30fb4dd","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:32.075Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ca284d79-1fd5-46d1-bb07-4584d30fb4dd","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01FHNAabmjV3gMvPUrswnS5d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SyTEovQeYqRdQx3cmC5n5c","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing","prompt":"What is the current 2026 price for Gemini 2.5 Pro per million input/output tokens on the ai.google.dev / Google AI Studio Gemini API? List standard context (<=200K) and large context tiers. Also note any free tier / batch discount."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4144,"cache_read_input_tokens":31477,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4144,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4HV3yDRqJdjJiMzW9f","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"bd602de2-ee22-4d33-955c-4606ebdca17c","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:34.460Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"bd602de2-ee22-4d33-955c-4606ebdca17c","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01FHNAabmjV3gMvPUrswnS5d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KqvucUhuQWziHDqZVCRbaH","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/start/openai","prompt":"Does Vertex AI provide an OpenAI-compatible endpoint for Gemini models? What is the base_url? Does it require Google Cloud authentication (access token) instead of a simple API key? Is gemini-2.5-pro accessible this way?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4144,"cache_read_input_tokens":31477,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4144,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4HV3yDRqJdjJiMzW9f","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"3c72de2e-ea25-4540-a059-7dd411fb0d79","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:36.003Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"bd602de2-ee22-4d33-955c-4606ebdca17c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"13d226c2-7030-46b3-a4a1-d92d92be18ee","agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SyTEovQeYqRdQx3cmC5n5c","type":"tool_result","content":"# Gemini 2.5 Pro Pricing (2026)\n\n## Standard Tier\n- **Input (≤200K tokens):** $1.25 per 1M tokens\n- **Output (≤200K tokens):** $10.00 per 1M tokens\n- **Input (>200K tokens):** $2.50 per 1M tokens\n- **Output (>200K tokens):** $15.00 per 1M tokens\n\n## Batch Tier (50% discount)\n- **Input (≤200K tokens):** $0.625 per 1M tokens\n- **Output (≤200K tokens):** $5.00 per 1M tokens\n- **Input (>200K tokens):** $1.25 per 1M tokens\n- **Output (>200K tokens):** $7.50 per 1M tokens\n\n## Free Tier\n\"Free of charge\" access is available for both input and output tokens on the free tier of Google AI Studio."}]},"uuid":"91b3c183-ac47-468f-be6e-0a8f66a5ed8f","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:39.362Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bd602de2-ee22-4d33-955c-4606ebdca17c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"3c72de2e-ea25-4540-a059-7dd411fb0d79","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"13d226c2-7030-46b3-a4a1-d92d92be18ee","agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KqvucUhuQWziHDqZVCRbaH","type":"tool_result","content":"# Vertex AI OpenAI Compatibility for Gemini\n\n**Yes**, Vertex AI provides an OpenAI-compatible endpoint for Gemini models.\n\n**Base URL:**\n```\nhttps://aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1/projects/{PROJECT_ID}/locations/{location}/endpoints/openapi\n```\n\n**Authentication:**\nYes, it requires Google Cloud authentication. According to the documentation: \"Only Google Cloud Auth is supported using the OpenAI library in Vertex AI.\" You must obtain an access token programmatically rather than using a simple API key.\n\n**Gemini 2.5 Pro:**\nThe documentation shows examples using `google/gemini-2.0-flash` and `google/gemini-2.5-flash`, but does not explicitly list `gemini-2.5-pro` as accessible through the OpenAI-compatible endpoint. The overview page (referenced but not fully shown) would specify which specific models are supported."}]},"uuid":"36e63a30-a71a-489c-920d-c36271d16775","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:56:41.275Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3c72de2e-ea25-4540-a059-7dd411fb0d79","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"36e63a30-a71a-489c-920d-c36271d16775","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6c3a5f3d9dc7d7f6","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01WDmEhaZxG6T66rTutYmUdM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough to deliver the verdict. Compiling final report.\n\n## $1000 Trial credit 使用范围\n\n- **Promo scope**: 仅限 **Vertex AI Search / Agent Builder (Discovery Engine) SKUs**, **不包含 Gemini API 调用**\n- **可信来源**:\n  - Google AI Developers Forum thread \"No one is talking about how to use the Credits...\" — 用户 krishnapathak 引述 Google Cloud Support 原话 \"The Trial credit for the GenAI App Builder will only be applied to Vertex AI search services\"; 多个用户 (yanc) 报告以为能跑 Gemini API, 结果 \"got charged tons of money\"\n  - 官方 pricing 页 `cloud.google.com/generative-ai-app-builder/pricing` (Agent Search SKU 命名空间)\n- **确认度**: **应该是**(95%) — Google 自己 forum 没出官方书面声明, 但 GCP Support 个案回复 + 多位踩坑用户 + SKU 命名空间三角验证一致. 100% 确认要 user 自己去 Console 看: `console.cloud.google.com/billing` → Credits → 点这条 promo → 看 \"Eligible products / SKUs\" 列表\n\n## Gemini API: Vertex AI vs ai.google.dev\n\n| 路径 | 能用 $1000 credit | Gemini 2.5 Pro 定价 (≤200K) | 认证 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **ai.google.dev** (Google AI Studio) | ❌ 不能 | $1.25 in / $10 out per M | API key |\n| **Vertex AI** (GCP 路径) | ❌ 也不能 (此 promo 不覆盖 Gemini SKU) | 同价 $1.25/$10 | GCP access token |\n\n定价两边一致, batch API 两边都能 50% off. **此 $1000 promo 跟 Gemini 没关系**.\n\n## OpenEvolve Vertex AI 支持\n\n- **走 OpenAI-compatible endpoint** 间接支持. README 官方示例只到 `generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/` (即 ai.google.dev OpenAI 兼容), Vertex AI **没官方文档** 但理论可用 `api_base: https://aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1/projects/{PID}/locations/{loc}/endpoints/openapi`\n- **坑**: Vertex AI OpenAI 兼容端**只接 GCP access token, 不接静态 API key**. OpenEvolve config 默认走 `api_key` 字段, 需要外部 token refresh 循环 (gcloud auth print-access-token 60 min 过期). 比 ai.google.dev 路径明显复杂\n- 官方 SDK 示例只 list `gemini-2.0-flash` / `gemini-2.5-flash`, **gemini-2.5-pro 在 OpenAI 兼容端可用性未明确文档化**\n\n## verdict\n\n- **$1000 credit cover Gemini API PoC: NO**. 这笔 credit 是 Vertex AI Search / Agent Builder (企业对话搜索) 限定, 跟 Gemini token-based API 完全两码事. 用户多次报告强用会被实际扣款\n- **推荐 PoC 路径**: 走 **ai.google.dev (Google AI Studio Gemini API)** + 静态 API key\n  - Gemini 2.5 Pro 标准 context $1.25 in / $10 out per M, 用 Batch API 立刻砍半\n  - OpenEvolve 官方示例直接覆盖, 零集成成本\n  - 500 iter PoC 估 $40-50 自费 / 或用 GCP Free Credit ($110.66 / 19 天) 补 — 注意 Free Credit 应当**能**覆盖 Gemini API on Vertex AI (因为 Free Credit scope 远比 GenAI App Builder promo 宽), 但 ai.google.dev 路径不走 GCP billing 所以 Free Credit 也用不上, 要省钱必须走 Vertex AI\n  - **省钱组合**: Vertex AI Gemini 2.5 Pro + GCP Free Credit + OpenEvolve config 加 Vertex OpenAI base_url + token refresh wrapper. 多花 0.5-1 天集成换 $40-50 ≈ 不划算, **直接 ai.google.dev 自费 $40-50** 更省时间\n- **要 user 自己 verify 的具体 URL**: https://console.cloud.google.com/billing → 选 billing account → \"Credits\" tab → 点 \"Trial credit for GenAI App Builder\" 行 → 看 \"Eligible products\" / \"Applies to\" 字段. 截图发回来 1 分钟就能盖章\n- **R13/R14 同款风险点**:\n  - **R13 类**: promo 名字带 \"GenAI\" 误导成\"覆盖所有 GenAI 服务\", 实际 SKU group 极窄 — 类似当年某些 GPU promo 只 cover 特定 region/instance type 的坑. **不读 SKU group 不下结论**\n  - **R14 类**: Vertex AI OpenAI 兼容端**没正式 SLA, 模型可用性按 region 漂移**, gemini-2.5-pro 在该端点的 availability 未官方文档化, 集成做完可能撞\"模型不在该端点\"硬墙. **PoC 阶段不要在这条路径上 sink 工时**\n\nSources:\n- [No one is talking about how to use the Credits of Trial credit for GenAI App Builder - Google AI Developers Forum](https://discuss.ai.google.dev/t/no-one-is-talking-about-how-to-use-the-credits-of-trial-credit-for-genai-app-builder/101423)\n- [Clarification on $1000 GenAI App Builder Credit Source - Google Developer forums](https://discuss.google.dev/t/clarification-on-1000-genai-app-builder-credit-source/350894)\n- [Agent Search pricing | Google Cloud](https://cloud.google.com/generative-ai-app-builder/pricing)\n- [Gemini Developer API pricing | Google AI for Developers](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing)\n- [OpenAI compatibility | Generative AI on Vertex AI | Google Cloud Documentation](https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/start/openai)\n- [codelion/openevolve GitHub repo](https://github.com/codelion/openevolve)\n- [Google Cloud Gen AI $1000 Fast-Start Program (cloudcredits.io)](https://cloudcredits.io/providers/gcp/programs/google-cloud-gen-ai-fast-start-program)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1121,"cache_read_input_tokens":35621,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1121,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4JQZ8bU3p72PhhCcjv","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"6beb64f3-26ff-4a45-a8b3-e7b21bd243be","timestamp":"2026-05-10T01:57:22.418Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
